emy-id "q-73145" :question/problem "What is the sum of the leading entries of the $1$st and $4$th rows in the matrix $A,$ given below?\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & -1 & 8 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The first non-zero entry of each row (from left to right) is the leading entry. \n\nTherefore, the leading entries of the $1$st and $4$th rows of $A$ are $1$ and $-3$, respectively.\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 0 & -1 & 8 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the answer is $1+(-3)=-2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-73145/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "31c3678b-4f00-54d6-bb84-c7718fd622cb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73145"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73146/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "f356329b-4520-5788-95d3-aba34949aa54" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73146/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "ff165f47-8b19-5cdd-bdbd-56c7fe164e11" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73146/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "370d87c7-c71f-5b4b-8cd8-0905531b0836" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73146/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "98778fd1-6561-5c5a-8829-06c7e8a80546" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73146/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "9100abd0-9e25-51ee-9930-a33a220b2a93" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-73146/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6447d76f-fb20-5bac-82f9-959645e13cf4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-73146/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer-field/choices ["q-73146/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-73146/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" "q-73146/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" "q-73146/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" "q-73146/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-73146" :question/id #uuid "d4ba5a43-58d7-50fb-ad62-5179abead4ee" :question/math-academy-id "q-73146" :question/problem "What is the sum of the leading entries of the $3$rd and $4$th rows in the matrix $A,$ given below?\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 6 & -3 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The first non-zero entry of each row (from left to right) is the leading entry. \n\nTherefore, the leading entries of the $3$rd and $4$th rows of $A$ are $1$ and $6$, respectively.\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 6 & -3 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the answer is $1+6=7.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-73146/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "31c3678b-4f00-54d6-bb84-c7718fd622cb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73146"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-73143/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "e95158cf-9271-5904-addf-b4c1e6658872" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:a