trix $A$ is in row echelon form (both conditions are satisfied).\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}6 & 0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- The matrix $B$ is not in row echelon form since the second row contains only zeros and it is not at the bottom of the matrix (condition I is violated).\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 3 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 4 & 4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- The matrix $C$ is not in row echelon form since the leading entry ${c}_{32}\\ne 0$ (condition II is violated). \n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, only $B$ and $C$ are **not** in row echelon form." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-72489/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2d390841-351e-54f5-ad19-90b6ebae5799"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72489"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72575/selection/b967c3002b3f913c5b31990d1f8159d3e1e979aa07e2842a8b67bfff1a2fd3f2" :answer/id #uuid "3a5a705d-a544-52ea-94bf-da25e44934cd" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ and $B$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72575/selection/e432f1020975ada4c83798ae75bfd6c0ae4dfe63215763f08b8be8ccabf8a5d3" :answer/id #uuid "64f5d116-69e2-5cf7-88f3-d51dd972878d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$C$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72575/selection/2377e3ffc3b5cd65e1036103e0b988e5af6634b2438c63c3b7cc0592571401ab" :answer/id #uuid "fc8a6d49-9cf0-537e-813f-25217fcb20ed" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ and $C$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72575/selection/685c02320dbe687345f93d820499dea4c0c82808b910e8a0e5841f77aa82209d" :answer/id #uuid "b85b5203-04c5-5b79-95f4-987c4549b8ef" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$A$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72575/selection/e956c